# The packed tarball is a build artifact — regenerated by run-consumption-test.mjs
# on every run (`npm pack` in src/ → normalized to this stable name). NEVER
# committed; the committed pnpm-lock.yaml is what pins resolution (NFR-004).
toolkit.tgz

# Build + install outputs.
dist/
# Second build of the consumption test, with DK_PUBLISH_DRAFTS=off, and the env
# file the test writes for it and removes again.
dist-nodrafts/
.env.production.local
.astro/
node_modules/

# Build-generated glossary pages. The `.contextive/definitions.yaml` corpus is
# the source of truth; the toolkit codegens `docs/glossary/**` at build time
# (config:setup). These are outputs — never hand-edited, never committed (WP03).
docs/glossary/

# Build-generated feature pages (gherkin `sources`, ADR-0046): outputs, never committed.
docs/behaviour/
